  "id": "map.themes",
  "says": "What goes into the card's holes. The first theme, Handwriting, is neonix's own hand-drawn card and is the only one that shows it. Every other theme draws with its own hand: its own holes, symbols, lines and type, at the places map.card gives, and never shows or traces the art. A theme never says where anything is, so every hole and every overlay symbol stands in the same place whatever theme is chosen. Font and colour palettes can change freely. symbols: art (the drawing's own), glyph, code, letter or word. line: solid, dashed or double.",
